:{"main":[[{"node":"Wait2","type":"main","index":0}]]}},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"staticData":null,"meta":null,"pinData":{"Schedule Trigger":[{"json":{"timestamp":"2025-05-15T22:20:08.174-04:00","Readable date":"May 15th 2025, 10:20:08 pm","Readable time":"10:20:08 pm","Day of week":"Thursday","Year":"2025","Month":"May","Day of month":"15","Hour":"22","Minute":"20","Second":"08","Timezone":"America/New_York (UTC-04:00)"}}],"Get row(s) in sheet":[{"json":{"row_number":2,"First Name":"Jessica ","Last Name":"","Email Address":"denorgerald@gmail.com","Phone Number":"","Country ":"United States","Location":"New York, New York","City":"","State":"","Industry":"events management","Founded Year":"","Employee":"","Company Name":"Rareform","Company Linkedin":"","Job Title":"Co-Founder and 1/2 of Rareform. Former Co-GM and Head of Digital","Headline":"","Seniority":"founder","Website URL":"https://www.rareform.com","LinkedIn URL":"http://www.linkedin.com/in/jessicaivypage","FB link":"","Twitter":"","Analysed":"Yes","Research Report":"*Personalization*  <br>1. Opportunity: Highlighting Jessica’s extensive experience leading digital strategy and marketing in the independent music industry, including her multiple senior roles at Mom+Pop Music and Caroline Distribution, and connecting that to Rareform’s direct and digital marketing efforts.  <br>Supporting Evidence: Jessica held roles such as VP of Digital Strategy, Director of Digital Strategy, and General Manager at Mom+Pop Music, plus Digital Marketing Manager at Caroline Distribution, giving her deep expertise in digital marketing for niche, creative industries. Rareform’s company description mentions direct marketing, digital, DSP, and release strategy to support independent artists – an alignment where Jessica’s background in marketing for indie artists can be acknowledged as a strong foundation for her rareform marketing leadership.  <br><br>2. Opportunity: Acknowledging Jessica’s role as Co-Founder of Rareform, which uniquely upcycles billboard vinyl into eco-friendly, vegan accessories, and appreciating the company’s innovative sustainability mission.  <br>Supporting Evidence: Rareform’s mission to reuse over 90% of billboard vinyl and transform it into durable, fashionable products stands out. Jessica’s involvement at the founding stage (3+ years) and Rareform’s positioning as a sustainable, eco-conscious brand in fashion presents a strong personalization opportunity to show admiration for their impact and innovative approach to environmental sustainability.  <br><br>⸻  <br><br>*Pain Points & Solutions*  <br>1. Pain Point: Managing the operational complexity of sourcing, sorting, cleaning, and tracking large volumes of recycled billboard vinyl material (up to 500,000 pounds monthly), including maintaining traceability and optimizing production workflows.  <br>Supporting Evidence: Rareform’s operations require collecting vast quantities of billboard vinyl, coordinating with advertising companies, ensuring quality control through sorting and cleaning, and managing supply chain logistics across multiple locations (Los Angeles and Nashville). These complex manual processes can be time-consuming, error-prone, and difficult to scale efficiently.  <br>Offer: Automate the inbound materials tracking and quality control process using AI-powered workflow automation tools that integrate with inventory management and supplier communications. This would reduce manual data entry and errors, provide real-time visibility into material intake and quality status, and free internal resources for higher-value tasks.  <br><br>2. Pain Point: Scaling and streamlining marketing efforts to grow brand visibility and sales within a niche sustainable fashion market, while minimizing time and overhead.  <br>Supporting Evidence: Rareform, as a small company (23 employees, under $1M revenue), likely faces resource constraints in maintaining continuous digital marketing campaigns, including SEO optimization and targeted outreach to eco-conscious consumers and independent artists. The reliance on digital and direct marketing to generate leads demands efficient, scalable lead generation processes.  <br>Offer: Implement marketing automation solutions focused on cold email outreach and SEO workflow automation that create steady inbound leads with minimal manual intervention—such as automating personalized cold email sequences to target independent artists, retailers, and eco-conscious partners alongside dynamic SEO content optimization. This would accelerate lead generation while preserving limited marketing bandwidth.","Email#1 Body":"Hey Jessica,<br><br>Your journey from Mom+Pop Music to transforming 500,000 pounds of billboard vinyl monthly at Rareform caught my attention online. Impressive sustainability mission!<br><br>I've noticed that managing the intake, sorting, and tracking of all that recycled vinyl material must create significant operational complexity for your team.<br><br>I've been working on streamlining these exact processes for sustainable manufacturers and would love to share some insights during a quick 15-minute call on Sunday. Should I book you in?<br><br>Kind regards,<br>Gerald","Email#1 Subject":"Jessica's Vinyl Revolution","Email #2 Body":"Hey Jessica,<br><br>Just pushing this back up your inbox incase you missed it.<br><br>Look forward to hearing from you.<br><br>Best regards,<br>Gerald","Email#3 Body":"Hey Jessica,<br><br>I was thinking about Rareform again and how challenging it must be to scale your marketing efforts in the niche sustainable fashion market with limited resources.<br><br>For small teams like yours with under $1M revenue, maintaining continuous digital marketing campaigns while focusing on your core mission can stretch bandwidth thin.<br><br>I'd love to share how our automation approaches have helped similar eco-conscious brands generate steady leads with minimal effort. Here's my calendar to book a brief 15-minute chat: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BMA2F9Gc2Cc&list=PLLR5I08I3SKSuL2-QX5gMPLxcR_LmnL_7<br><br>Kind regards,<br>Gerald","Email#3 Subject":"Rareform Marketing Scaling","Sender Email":1,"Time Zone":"T1","Email#1 Sent":"No","Email#2 Sent":"No","Email#3 Sent":"No","Message ID":"","Watched?":"No","Replied":"No","Token":693379,"Opted Out":"No","Seen E1":"","Seen E2":"","Seen E3":""}},{"json":{"row_number":3,"First Name":"Krystle ","Last Name":"Mobayeni","Email Address":"misel@olpoy.com","Phone Number":12127489156,"Country ":"United States","Location":"New York, New York","City":"","State":"","Industry":"events management","Founded Year":"","Employee":"","Company Name":"BentoBox","Company Linkedin":"","Job Title":"CEO","Headline":"","Seniority":"c_suite","Website URL":"http://www.linkedin.com/in/krystlemobayeni","LinkedIn URL":"http://www.linkedin.com/in/krystlemobayeni","FB link":"","Twitter":"","Analysed":"Yes","Research Report":"*Personalization*  <br>1. Opportunity: Highlight Krystle Mobayeni’s long tenure as CEO since BentoBox’s founding in 2013 and her leadership role steering the company’s sustained growth and innovation in restaurant technology.  <br>Supporting Evidence: Krystle Mobayeni has been CEO at BentoBox for over 12 years, from its inception to today, indicating deep commitment and hands-on leadership driving the company’s mission to empower restaurants digitally.  <br><br>2. Opportunity: Reference BentoBox’s unique position as a platform that places diners at the center of restaurant operations, focusing on enhancing guest experience through tools like QR code ordering, event management, and customized websites.  <br>Supporting Evidence: BentoBox’s platform is described as “the first in the industry to put diners at the center” and offers a range of features designed to improve diner engagement and operational efficiencies, which is a compelling narrative to connect with.  <br><br>⸻  <br><br>*Pain Points & Solutions*  <br>1. Pain Point: Managing and scaling complex digital marketing and ordering operations for a large and diverse restaurant customer base likely involves significant manual tasks that can introduce errors and inefficiencies.  <br>Supporting Evidence: BentoBox serves over 14,000 restaurants globally and offers multiple integrated tools—website creation, reservations, online ordering, eCommerce stores—implying complex internal workflows that need constant updating and support to maintain consistency and performance.  <br>Offer: Automate the updating and synchronization of restaurant websites, menus, and event calendars across all client profiles using AI-driven workflow automation, reducing manual updates and errors, thereby saving BentoBox’s support and operations teams time and improving accuracy.  <br><br>2. Pain Point: Generating consistent high-quality leads and scaling outreach to new restaurant clients while minimizing time spent on repetitive marketing tasks such as SEO optimization, cold emails, and content promotion.  <br>Supporting Evidence: BentoBox is growing steadily and hiring often, indicating a need to accelerate customer acquisition efficiently. Their marketing relies heavily on online presence and digital channels which can be resource intensive to manage manually.  <br>Offer: Implement AI-powered marketing automation for lead generation—automating cold email outreach campaigns with personalized messaging and SEO optimization for BentoBox’s digital content—to increase inbound restaurant prospects and reduce manual marketing workload.","Email#1 Body":"Hey Krystle,<br><br>Saw online how you've been leading BentoBox for over 12 years, building it into a platform that uniquely places diners at the center of restaurant operations - impressive journey since 2013!<br><br>Managing digital operations for 14,000+ restaurants globally must create significant challenges with manual updates across websites, menus, and event calendars, especially when each restaurant has unique needs.<br><br>I've been working on automation solutions specifically for restaurant tech platforms that could eliminate these manual processes. Would love to share these insights during a quick 15-minute call on Sunday.<br><br>Should I book you in?<br><br>Kind regards,<br>Gerald","Email#1 Subject":"BentoBox's Digital Revolution","Email #2 Body":"Hey Krystle,<br><br>Just pushing this back up your inbox incased you missed it.<br><br>Look forward to hearing from you.<br><br>Best regards,<br>Gerald","Email#3 Body":"Hey Krystle,<br><br>I was thinking about BentoBox again and your growing operation. With your focus on scaling customer acquisition, I imagine your teams spend considerable time on repetitive marketing tasks like SEO optimization and outreach campaigns to potential restaurant clients.<br><br>Many restaurant tech platforms we've worked with found their marketing teams were spending 15+ hours weekly on these manual tasks that could be automated.<br><br>I'd love to share how AI-powered marketing automation could increase your inbound restaurant prospects while reducing that manual workload. Here's my calendar to book a quick 15-minute chat: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BMA2F9Gc2Cc&list=PLLR5I08I3SKSuL2-QX5gMPLxcR_LmnL_7<br><br>Kind regards,<br>Gerald","Email#3 Subject":"Quick BentoBox thought","Sender Email":2,"Time Zone":"T1","Email#1 Sent":"No","Email#2 Sent":"No","Email#3 Sent":"No","Message ID":"196e90f151c51f73","Watched?":"No","Replied":"No","Token":960586,"Opted Out":"No","Seen E1":"","Seen E2":"","Seen E3":""}},{"json":{"row_number":4,"First Name":"Jill ","Last Name":"Bergstresser","Email Address":"misel@olpoy.com","Phone Number":12122172270,"Country ":"United States","Location":"New York, New York","City":"","State":"","Industry":"events management","Founded Year":"","Employee":"","Company Name":"Powerhouse Group","Company Linkedin":"","Job Title":"Founder & CEO","Headline":"","Seniority":"founder","Website URL":"http://www.linkedin.com/in/jill-bergstresser-85756246","LinkedIn URL":"http://www.linkedin.com/in/jill-bergstresser-85756246","FB link":"","Twitter":"","Analysed":"No","Research Report":"","Email#1 Body":"","Email#1 Subject":"","Email #2 Body":"","Email#3 Body":"","Email#3 Subject":"","Sender Email":3,"Time Zone":"T1","Email#1 Sent":"No","Email#2 Sent":"No","Email#3 Sent":"No","Message ID":"","Watched?":"No","Replied":"No","Token":507819,"Opted Out":"No","Seen E1":"","Seen E2":"","Seen E3":""}},{"json":{"row_number":6,"First Name":"Gerald","Last Name":"","Email Address":"misel@olpoy.com","Phone Number":"","Country ":"United States","Location":"New York, New York","City":"","State":"","Industry":"events management","Founded Year":"","Employee":"","Company Name":"Sunsoft","Company Linkedin":"","Job Title":"Co-Founder ","Headline":"","Seniority":"founder","Website URL":"https://www.dominixai.com","LinkedIn URL":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/gerald-akhidenor-1ab1a45/","FB link":"","Twitter":"","Analysed":"Yes","Research Report":"*Personalization*  <br>1. Opportunity: Highlight Jessica’s dual role as Co-Founder of Rareform and her previous leadership experience at Mom+Pop Music, especially focusing on her digital and marketing expertise.  <br>Supporting Evidence: Jessica has a strong background in digital strategy and marketing, having served as VP and Director of Digital Strategy and General Manager at Mom+Pop Music before co-founding Rareform. This unique combination of music industry digital marketing and sustainable retail entrepreneurship positions her as someone deeply familiar with both branding and audience engagement in emerging markets.<br><br>2. Opportunity: Reference Rareform’s commitment to sustainability and innovative reuse of billboard vinyl into unique, eco-friendly bags and accessories.  <br>Supporting Evidence: Rareform’s business model is centered on collecting and repurposing nearly 500,000 pounds of billboard vinyl monthly into waterproof, vegan, and unique accessories, emphasizing sustainability and ethical manufacturing. This highlights a mission-driven brand with operational complexity around material sourcing, production, and distribution.<br><br>⸻<br><br>*Pain Points & Solutions*  <br>1. Pain Point: Managing and scaling the collection, sorting, and production workflows for repurposing large volumes of billboard vinyl, which likely involves manual, time-consuming processes that can limit efficiency and responsiveness.  <br>Supporting Evidence: Rareform collects approximately 500,000 pounds of billboard vinyl monthly that needs sorting, cleaning, hand-cutting, and sewing—indicating a complex supply chain and production workflow with many manual touchpoints prone to bottlenecks or errors. As a small team (~23 employees), operational efficiency is critical.  <br>Offer: We can automate the vinyl intake and inventory tracking process by implementing a custom workflow automation that digitizes and integrates supplier intake documentation, barcode or RFID tracking of raw materials, and real-time inventory updates. This reduces manual data entry errors and accelerates materials flow from collection to production planning.<br><br>2. Pain Point: Generating and nurturing targeted leads efficiently for Rareform’s ecommerce and retail sales, in a way that maximizes marketing ROI while minimizing time spent on repetitive outreach.  <br>Supporting Evidence: As a sustainable accessories brand targeting eco-conscious customers and emphasizing unique design, Rareform likely relies on marketing to grow its customer base. Jessica’s strong digital marketing background suggests lead generation and outreach are vital but potentially time-intensive areas.  <br>Offer: We can implement automated cold email campaigns and lead follow-up sequences specifically customized for eco-lifestyle retailers and boutique buyers, integrated with CRM tools, enabling personalized, scalable outreach that drives qualified leads with minimal ongoing manual effort.<br><br>","Email#1 Body":"Hey Gerald,<br><br>I noticed on LinkedIn how Rareform transforms 500,000 pounds of billboard vinyl monthly into eco-friendly bags - incredible sustainability mission!<br><br>With that volume, I'm wondering if the sorting and production workflow sometimes creates bottlenecks when scaling, especially with your team of around 23 employees.<br><br>I've been helping similar operations automate their material tracking processes and would love to share some insights during a quick 15-minute call on Friday. Should I book you in?<br><br>Kind regards,<br>Gerald","Email#1 Subject":"Vinyl wastage solution","Email #2 Body":"Hey Gerald,<br><br>Just pushing this back up your inbox incase you missed it.<br><br>Look forward to hearing from you.<br><br>Best regards,<br>Gerald","Email#3 Body":"Hey Gerald,<br><br>I was thinking about Rareform again and your unique position in the eco-conscious accessories market.<br><br>For brands with such a strong sustainability story, I've noticed targeted lead generation often becomes time-intensive, pulling focus from your core operations and product innovation.<br><br>We've developed some interesting approaches to automate personalized outreach to eco-lifestyle retailers that might be valuable for you. Would you be open to a quick 15-minute discussion?<br><br>Here's my calendar to pick a time that works for you: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BMA2F9Gc2Cc&list=PLLR5I08I3SKSuL2-QX5gMPLxcR_LmnL_7<br><br>Kind regards,<br>Gerald","Email#3 Subject":"Rareform marketing idea","Sender Email":2,"Time Zone":"T1","Email#1 Sent":"No","Email#2 Sent":"No","Email#3 Sent":"No","Message ID":"","Watched?":"No","Replied":"No","Token":325795,"Opted Out":"No","Seen E1":"","Seen E2":"","Seen E3":""}}]},"versionId":"098f84d3-0e94-47f9-9c83-a700b42216b4","triggerCount":0,"shared":[{"createdAt":"2025-06-28T08:47:42.431Z","updatedAt":"2025-06-28T08:47:42.431Z","role":"workflow:owner","workflowId":"u92wFO5A5GxuBiel","projectId":"roCKyeuuwaNdcgDf"}],"tags":[{"createdAt":"2025-06-28T08:46:14.709Z","u